WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.956 --> 00:00:14.437
you sure this will work?"

2
00:00:15.497 --> 00:00:19.799
Mellis stood, trembling, on the roof of an abandoned building at the edge of the village.

3
00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:21.920
Zann gave her a thumbs-up.

4
00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.781
"Just do what we taught you," he called.

5
00:00:24.801 --> 00:00:26.962
"Deceleration spells are pretty easy."

6
00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:29.483
"And don't worry," Perda added.

7
00:00:29.503 --> 00:00:34.626
"If it looks like you're in trouble, Zann and I will stop you before you hit the ground."

8
00:00:35.706 --> 00:00:37.087
Zann smiled at Perda.

9
00:00:37.867 --> 00:00:41.349
It was fun working with her to teach Mellis basic magic skills.

10
00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:45.491
They'd been at it since seeing Vilkor at the village green the day before.

11
00:00:45.511 --> 00:00:48.413
"Okay, here I go!"

12
00:00:49.073 --> 00:00:52.815
Mellis glanced at Zing, who was flying in lazy circles nearby.

13
00:00:54.696 --> 00:00:56.557
She stepped off the edge of the roof.

14
00:00:57.758 --> 00:00:58.839
Zann held his breath.

15
00:00:58.859 --> 00:01:00.479
"Can she do it?"

16
00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:01.340
he thought.

17
00:01:01.888 --> 00:01:05.529
He rubbed a hand against his leg, just in case he needed to save her.

18
00:01:06.229 --> 00:01:10.070
But halfway down, Mellis' fall slowed—and then stopped.

19
00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.051
She floated in midair.

20
00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:16.612
"Hey!" she cried, sounding surprised and delighted.

21
00:01:16.632 --> 00:01:18.133
"I did it!

22
00:01:18.673 --> 00:01:19.793
I decelerated!"

23
00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:22.694
"You did more than that," Perda said.

24
00:01:22.714 --> 00:01:26.855
"You decelerated so much that now you're levitating!

25
00:01:27.695 --> 00:01:30.496
I guess we don't need to bother teaching you that now."

26
00:01:31.408 --> 00:01:32.129
Zann laughed.

27
00:01:33.129 --> 00:01:34.810
"Yeah. You're a fast learner, Mellis!"

28
00:01:35.571 --> 00:01:37.352
Mellis floated the rest of the way down.

29
00:01:37.372 --> 00:01:39.393
"Thanks," she said.

30
00:01:39.413 --> 00:01:40.955
"Magic is fun!"

31
00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:42.616
Zann grinned.

32
00:01:42.636 --> 00:01:44.237
"Okay, here's a pop quiz.

33
00:01:45.017 --> 00:01:46.638
Create a chair so I can sit down."

34
00:01:47.919 --> 00:01:49.780
Mellis laughed and snapped her fingers.

35
00:01:50.661 --> 00:01:51.862
A lounge chair appeared.

36
00:01:52.422 --> 00:01:53.603
Zann flopped onto it.

37
00:01:53.623 --> 00:01:56.565
"Now do a Vanishing spell," Perda said.

38
00:01:57.225 --> 00:01:58.726
Mellis snapped her fingers again.

39
00:01:58.746 --> 00:02:02.652
The lounge chair became invisible, but Zann could still feel it.

40
00:02:02.672 --> 00:02:05.273
"Now do a Shackle spell," Zann said.

41
00:02:05.293 --> 00:02:07.254
"Okay," Mellis said.

42
00:02:07.874 --> 00:02:10.415
Suddenly Zann felt shackles on his wrists.

43
00:02:10.435 --> 00:02:12.715
"Hey!" Zann laughed.

44
00:02:13.716 --> 00:02:14.936
"Unshackle me!"

45
00:02:16.016 --> 00:02:18.457
Mellis smiled as she pretended to be confused.

46
00:02:18.477 --> 00:02:22.638
"Hmm, I'm not sure I remember how to do that."

47
00:02:23.418 --> 00:02:27.519
Perda laughed, and Zing flew down and shot a playful spurt of flame at Zann.

48
00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:28.940
Zann laughed too.

49
00:02:29.708 --> 00:02:32.209
But then he noticed Zira walking past.

50
00:02:32.809 --> 00:02:34.869
He quickly hid the shackles and stood up.

51
00:02:34.889 --> 00:02:37.850
"Oh, hello, kids," Zira said.

52
00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:40.111
"It's a lovely day, isn't it?

53
00:02:40.871 --> 00:02:43.572
But I'm afraid I have no time for small talk.

54
00:02:44.232 --> 00:02:46.233
I'm late for a meeting with Krub."

55
00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:49.093
She hurried on and disappeared around a corner.

56
00:02:49.633 --> 00:02:51.994
Zann and the girls exchanged a worried look.

57
00:02:52.014 --> 00:02:55.095
"Do you think she guessed what we're doing?"

58
00:02:55.595 --> 00:02:56.295
Mellis wondered.

59
00:02:56.995 --> 00:02:57.676
Perda shrugged.

60
00:02:57.696 --> 00:02:58.896
"I doubt it.

61
00:02:59.352 --> 00:03:00.833
She was walking pretty fast.

62
00:03:01.354 --> 00:03:02.254
But never mind her.

63
00:03:02.895 --> 00:03:05.036
Unshackle Zann, and then we'll teach you more."

64
00:03:06.757 --> 00:03:11.040
By the next morning, Zann and Perda had taught Mellis every spell they knew.

65
00:03:11.981 --> 00:03:14.302
After breakfast they reviewed a few things.

66
00:03:14.322 --> 00:03:17.745
"Try displacing the water from the pond," Zann suggested.

67
00:03:17.765 --> 00:03:20.326
"But don't worry if you're only able to move part of it.

68
00:03:20.887 --> 00:03:24.029
Displacement spells are difficult, and they use lots of energy."

69
00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.372
Mellis rubbed her hands together, causing sparks to fly.

70
00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.841
Then she pointed at the pond.

71
00:03:31.842 --> 00:03:36.605
Zann and Perda gasped and jumped back as all the water flew up in the air.

72
00:03:37.406 --> 00:03:39.007
It disappeared into the sky.

73
00:03:39.027 --> 00:03:41.689
"Yikes!" Mellis said.

74
00:03:41.709 --> 00:03:43.110
"Did I do it wrong?"

75
00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:46.292
"No." Perda looked impressed.

76
00:03:46.312 --> 00:03:49.795
"But you might have used a little too much energy."

77
00:03:50.495 --> 00:03:51.796
Zann squinted upward.

78
00:03:52.597 --> 00:03:54.898
After a moment the pond water reappeared.

79
00:03:54.918 --> 00:03:56.099
"Look out!"

80
00:03:56.399 --> 00:03:56.820
he cried.

81
00:03:58.496 --> 00:04:01.658
The water splashed down, splattering everywhere.

82
00:04:03.119 --> 00:04:04.761
"Oops," Mellis said.

83
00:04:04.781 --> 00:04:06.902
"Don't worry," Perda said.

84
00:04:06.922 --> 00:04:10.024
"You'll soon have better control of your magic energy."

85
00:04:10.785 --> 00:04:11.545
Zann nodded.

86
00:04:12.246 --> 00:04:16.469
"When I was younger, I once tried to create a cookie under the table because I didn't like

87
00:04:16.509 --> 00:04:16.969
my dinner.

88
00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:20.932
But I accidentally created ten cookies, and my parents caught me."

89
00:04:22.353 --> 00:04:24.154
He grinned sheepishly at the memory.

90
00:04:24.995 --> 00:04:26.076
Then he sighed.

91
00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.802
Thinking about his family made him miss them.

92
00:04:30.042 --> 00:04:31.744
Perda seemed to be feeling the same way.

93
00:04:31.764 --> 00:04:35.967
"I think we've taught you everything we can," she told Mellis.

94
00:04:35.987 --> 00:04:38.609
"Now you just need to practice."

95
00:04:39.469 --> 00:04:40.510
Mellis looked sad.

96
00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.972
"Does that mean you're leaving Terrica?

97
00:04:43.892 --> 00:04:44.773
I understand.

98
00:04:45.133 --> 00:04:46.674
You must miss your home world.

99
00:04:47.215 --> 00:04:49.136
Can I come along to say good-bye?

100
00:04:49.977 --> 00:04:51.958
I've been meaning to visit the well anyway.

101
00:04:51.978 --> 00:04:54.260
I think I lost something out there."

102
00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:58.242
Just then Zira and Krub zapped into view.

103
00:04:58.262 --> 00:05:00.203
"Is your uncle home?"

104
00:05:00.723 --> 00:05:01.423
Zira asked.

105
00:05:01.443 --> 00:05:03.905
"He's inside," Mellis said.

106
00:05:04.645 --> 00:05:07.006
The two adults disappeared into the farmhouse.

107
00:05:07.026 --> 00:05:11.109
"I wonder if Krub knows the truth about magic," Perda said.

108
00:05:11.129 --> 00:05:13.470
"He and Zira seem pretty close."

109
00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:18.072
Before Zann could respond, they all heard raised voices inside.

110
00:05:18.893 --> 00:05:21.194
Vilkor seemed to be arguing with the other two.

111
00:05:21.214 --> 00:05:24.616
"Let's go while they're distracted," Mellis said.

112
00:05:25.172 --> 00:05:27.193
"I don't want my uncle to ask where we're going."

113
00:05:28.493 --> 00:05:29.634
They zapped to the well.

114
00:05:30.534 --> 00:05:33.496
Zann was startled to find the area mobbed with people.

115
00:05:33.516 --> 00:05:36.737
"What's going on?"

116
00:05:37.077 --> 00:05:40.118
Perda asked as an excited-looking woman bumped into her.

117
00:05:40.979 --> 00:05:44.740
Zann glanced at the wall Zira had created around the well and the tree.

118
00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.841
Lots of people were touching it or gazing at it.

119
00:05:47.861 --> 00:05:51.603
"I guess people heard where the magic energy came from," he said.

120
00:05:51.623 --> 00:05:53.824
"I wonder if Vilkor and Zira know that."

121
00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:55.981
Mellis looked worried.

122
00:05:56.001 --> 00:05:58.283
"They'll be angry when they find out."

123
00:05:59.023 --> 00:05:59.944
She cleared her throat.

124
00:05:59.964 --> 00:06:02.927
"Attention, everyone!"

125
00:06:03.367 --> 00:06:07.010
she said, using a Swelling spell to make her voice louder than normal.

126
00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:09.472
"This is private property.

127
00:06:09.932 --> 00:06:11.133
Please disperse!"

128
00:06:12.134 --> 00:06:14.116
Only a few people seemed to hear her.

129
00:06:14.676 --> 00:06:15.617
But none of them listened.

130
00:06:15.637 --> 00:06:19.360
"Just get out of here as soon as we leave," Perda suggested.

131
00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:21.802
"That way nobody can blame you for this."

132
00:06:22.682 --> 00:06:25.336
Zann nodded and grabbed Zing.

133
00:06:25.356 --> 00:06:26.997
"We'll miss you, Mellis," he said.

134
00:06:27.017 --> 00:06:28.818
"Maybe we'll visit again some time."

135
00:06:28.838 --> 00:06:31.980
"That would be great," Mellis said.

136
00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.661
"I'll miss you both.

137
00:06:34.621 --> 00:06:35.822
Thanks for everything!"

138
00:06:36.502 --> 00:06:37.323
They all hugged.

139
00:06:38.563 --> 00:06:43.766
Then Zann and Perda created a Mutual Shackle spell so either of them could undo it.

140
00:06:44.506 --> 00:06:46.888
Zann also shackled himself to Zing.

141
00:06:47.808 --> 00:06:50.450
"You should zap us inside the wall," Zann said.

142
00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:52.911
"You're much more accurate at that sort of thing."

143
00:06:53.771 --> 00:06:54.472
Perda nodded.

144
00:06:55.368 --> 00:06:55.611
"Zap!"
